  "_structural": "Sets the design's STRUCTURE \u2014 navigation, stages, filters, entry kinds. Every identity in these must be drawn: they are the vocabulary a person reads, and one missing is a screen that cannot say something the product can. The rest are SAMPLE content \u2014 ticket titles, lane names, specific refs \u2014 which a design illustrates rather than enumerates. A gate that demands every sample row reports misses that are not misses, and a gate that cries wolf is a gate nobody runs.",
